# string_ops: 16-byte literal appends with period-5 seed resets;
# K=125, N=6000.  Appends unwind (call down, then concatenate) so the
# resets cannot discard them below; resets bound M1's leak-every-
# concatenation behavior to linear growth (peak string 72 bytes).
